ster</i>? Do it again. And again. Across every timeline!<br><br>Time travel is your endgame. Every leap backward reveals harder challenges.<br><br>Geography shifts. Quests, strategic points, and enemy types evolve. New bosses emerge. Do you have what it takes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 6 playable Wargears with unique weapons and signature abilities<br>• 6 Essences to combine for diverse spell builds<br>• 72 spell and evolutions + 70 abilities evolutions<br>• 148 collectible items: 80 Artifacts, 36 Relics, 12 Shards, 20 Potions<br>• 20 troop types to deploy and upgrade<br>• 38 buildings across Bastion, domains, strategic points, and towers.<br>• 31 enemy types across multiple factions and bosses<br>• Procedurally generated maps with evolving enemy factions<br>• Time-travel ascension’s level, introducing new challenges.<br>• Rogue-lite progression that unlocks new powers and strategies each runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETREATING ENDS HERE. WILL YOU ANSWER THE CALL?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Retreating ends here. Defend Bastion against evil hordes, reclaim lost powers, rebuild ancient ruins, and adapt your tactics to reverse the siege. Shape your playstyle in this hero-strategy rogue-lite solo or co-op up to 3 players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363680/8f72c430d124eda7638f9df0fff72aab24be5c7c/header.jpg?t=1782394991", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363680/91c27998b668bc544f22343f41b6e3698823de3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782394991", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363680/91c27998b668bc544f22343f41b6e3698823de3a/capsule_184